@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+`order-triage`
+
+Classify each supplied order for human review.
+
+- Base the classification only on the supplied order information.
+- Send the classification for human review.
+- Do not approve refunds or claim authority to approve them.
+- When information needed for a reliable classification is missing or ambiguous, identify the uncertainty for the human reviewer instead of inventing an answer.

