--- /dev/null
+++ b/moldea/runtimes/custom.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+The project creates the `order-triage` runtime agent through `createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts`. The factory receives a runtime-owned canonical instruction loader and requests `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`; callers must provide that loader when constructing the agent.
+
+The returned runtime object identifies the agent as `order-triage`, exposes `action: classify-for-human-review`, and fixes `canApproveRefunds` to `false`.
